sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Metzger et al. (2008) & Menshykau et al. (2012, 2014) mouse lung stereotyped branching modes (Domain D, Planar P, Orthogonal O) and FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 Turing mode selection — MorphoEval overall 91.0/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2 remediated) evaluation of `2008-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching.py` (91.1/100, up from 50.3/100 in Pass 1; +40.8 overall). The remediated script implements Metzger et al.'s (2008) full compound 3D lobar branching grammar (Domain Branching D_m with 90 deg circumferential domain shifts followed by Planar P Delta_phi = 0 deg margin and Orthogonal O Delta_phi = 90 deg interior bifurcations, satisfying the exact 4m + 1 = 17 active-tip law); couples it to Menshykau et al.'s (2012, 2014) mesenchymal FGF10 + epithelial SHH/Ptch1 receptor-ligand Schnakenberg-type Turing reaction-diffusion system (lambda_T = 1.4229, k_c^2 = 19.50) and semi-implicit spectral PDE mode switch; validates against 8 empirical E12.5-E14.5 mouse lung lineages (dihedral RMSE = 1.98 deg, r = 0.9994) and the E11.0-E14.5 distal tip timecourse (r = 1.0000); segments N = 32 3-arm bronchial junctions on the SHA-256-locked mammalian bronchial tree specimen (`bronchial_tree_specimen.jpg`, mean angle 76.49 ± 14.61 deg, caliber ratio 0.8826); and is backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_053_lung_stereotyped_branching_modes.lean`. Overall 91.0/100 (faithfulness 90.3, reproducibility 92.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 88, Parameter expressivity 89, Morphometric validation 90, Source and data traceability 94, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/lung_stereotyped_branching_modes_comparison.png: rendered output of 2008-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching.py at 8871db0, image/png, 736689 B, 2552×1537 px, artifact_sha256 0670e835a692cf4f5264078ccc221032e26698ef2ba21ee515959eaf13b4f405 (sha256 0670e835a692cf4f5264078ccc221032e26698ef2ba21ee515959eaf13b4f405), spec_fingerprint 253a37a14bc1e93edeec7f1a1f8bb0a117cab5067487066a4dceb4dff88210cb. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 253a37a14bc1e93edeec7f1a1f8bb0a117cab5067487066a4dceb4dff88210cb; artifact_sha256: 0670e835a692cf4f5264078ccc221032e26698ef2ba21ee515959eaf13b4f405; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/lung_stereotyped_branching_modes/bronchial_tree_specimen.jpg=3247bc8c35eddcad..., datasets/lung_stereotyped_branching_modes/lung_stereotyped_branching_modes_reference.json=0a40515eda235917...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-lung-stereotyped-branching-modes-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 1D epithelial-tip FGF10-SHH-Ptch1 reaction-diffusion solver to a moving 3D phase-field or boundary-element mesenchymal pleura cavity to simulate pleura-constrained lobe flattening directly.",
            "remediation needed: Extend the E11-E15 bronchial lineage grammar to include stochastic terminal saccular-to-alveolar septation beyond E16.5." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.91"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Loop 053 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

